+# Modifications
+
+This is a fork of FusionCore by Manan Kharwar
+(https://github.com/manankharwar/fusioncore), released under the
+Apache License 2.0. The upstream LICENSE file is retained unchanged.
+
+Modified by Rustam, 2026, for an independent evaluation of the claims
+in arXiv:2605.25239. All changes are on branch `verification`, based
+on upstream commit 99503ca.
+
+## Files changed
+
+- `fusioncore_core/include/fusioncore/fusioncore.hpp`
+  Added the SPEED_IMPLAUSIBLE rejection reason and the
+  gnss_max_implied_speed configuration field.
+- `fusioncore_core/src/fusioncore.cpp`
+  Added an implied-speed pre-gate in update_gnss(), upstream of the
+  chi-squared gate. Applied the B_EWZ noise scale in the constructor.
+- `fusioncore_core/include/fusioncore/ukf.hpp`,
+  `fusioncore_core/src/ukf.cpp`
+  Added set_encoder_wz_bias_noise_scale() and applied it to
+  Q[B_EWZ,B_EWZ] in predict(), mirroring the existing position and
+  gyro-bias noise scales.
+- `fusioncore_ros/src/fusion_node.cpp`
+  Parameter plumbing for both features. Added a guard in
+  publish_state() that suppresses publishes when the clock has not
+  advanced since the previous one.
+- `fusioncore_datasets/scripts/nclt_player.py`
+  Stop the executor at the end of playback; guard the second
+  rclpy.shutdown() call.
+- `fusioncore_datasets/launch/nclt_benchmark.launch.py`
+  Added an OnProcessExit handler so the stack shuts down when
+  playback ends. Added the two debug topics to the recorded list.
+- `fusioncore_datasets/config/nclt_fusioncore.yaml`
+  Added parameters for both features.
+- `fusioncore_core/tests/test_gnss_manager.cpp`,
+  `fusioncore_core/tests/test_encoder.cpp`
+  Four new unit tests.
+
+## Defaults
+
+Both experimental features default to upstream behaviour: the
+pre-gate is disabled (0.0) and the B_EWZ state is active (1.0).
+They must be enabled explicitly for experiments.
+
+## Data
+
+Evaluation used the University of Michigan NCLT dataset
+(Carlevaris-Bianco, Ushani and Eustice, IJRR 2016), released under
+the Open Database License. No dataset files are redistributed here.
